+# Admin Panel MVP Implementation Plan
+
+> **For agentic workers:** REQUIRED SUB-SKILL: Use superpowers:subagent-driven-development (recommended) or superpowers:executing-plans to implement this plan task-by-task. Steps use checkbox (`- [ ]`) syntax for tracking.
+
+**Goal:** Build a production-ready admin dashboard (MVP) with dashboard KPIs, and full CRUD for Bikes, Scooters, and Parts inventory, protected by role-based access control.
+
+**Architecture:** Admin panel at `/app/admin` protected by middleware role checks (SUPER_ADMIN | ADMIN). Database schema extends User, Vehicle, and Part models. Clerk auth drives identity; Prisma User table drives authorization. Uploadthing handles image uploads. ActivityLog records all admin mutations for audit trail. Dashboard pulls data from `/api/admin/dashboard`; CRUD modules use `/api/admin/[bikes|scooters|parts]` routes.
+
+**Tech Stack:** Next.js 14 App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui (Button, Card, Dialog, Input, Select, Table, Sheet, DropdownMenu, Toast), Recharts (bar + pie charts), TanStack Table (@tanstack/react-table), Uploadthing, Prisma + PostgreSQL, Zod validation, react-hook-form.
+
+**Spec:** `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-05-admin-panel-mvp-design.md`
+
+## Global Constraints
+
+- Clerk remains auth provider; no switch to NextAuth
+- Hard delete for MVP (soft delete Phase 2)
+- Role enum: SUPER_ADMIN | ADMIN | USER (migrate existing ADMIN → SUPER_ADMIN, CLIENT → USER)
+- Currency: NPR (Rs.), dates: YYYY-MM-DD
+- Admin routes: `/app/admin/(dashboard)/*`
+- API routes: `/app/api/admin/*`
+- Components: `/components/admin/*`
+- Libs: `/lib/admin/*` (permissions, dashboard helpers, validations)
+- Existing vehicle/part APIs remain unchanged; admin APIs layer on top
+
+## Review Focus
+
+1. **Unauthorized access to `/admin/*`:** Non-admins (USER role) can access routes via URL bar — middleware must catch and redirect to `/permission-denied` before rendering.
+2. **Missing ActivityLog on mutations:** Admin creates a bike, but ActivityLog doesn't record it — audit trail incomplete.
+3. **Image upload failure:** Uploadthing config missing or API key unset — image fields silently fail to upload.
+4. **Role migration data loss:** Existing ADMIN/CLIENT users not migrated to SUPER_ADMIN/USER before schema enforces enum values.
+5. **Dashboard chart data stale:** KPI cards show old revenue; endpoint not revalidating on stock/order changes.
+
